# Slack — no browser

Read Slack only with the Slack MCP tools (`slack_read_channel`, `slack_read_thread`, `slack_search_public_and_private`, and the other `slack_*` tools).

Never open Chrome, Playwright, or any other browser to load a Slack URL. This includes an empty thread, a missing timestamp, a failed search, or a permalink the API did not return.

If those tools do not return the message, say so and ask for a paste. Stop. Do not switch tools.
